          "java",
          "// Java: Generic class\npublic class Box<T> {\n    private T content;\n\n    public Box(T content) {\n        this.content = content;\n    }\n\n    public T getContent() {\n        return content;\n    }\n\n    public void setContent(T content) {\n        this.content = content;\n    }\n\n    public boolean isEmpty() {\n        return content == null;\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage - type safety enforced at compile time\nBox<String> stringBox = new Box<>(\"Hello\");\nString value = stringBox.getContent();  // No cast needed\n\nBox<Integer> intBox = new Box<>(42);\nint number = intBox.getContent();\n\n// Box<String> wrongBox = new Box<>(42);  // Compile error!"
        ]
      ]
    },
